        "text": "In the general discussion channel, community members raised questions about the ELIZA token and the ElizaOS project. One user asked about the latest updates regarding the ELIZA token price, noting it appeared to be very low and questioning whether the project was still active or had been abandoned. Another community member clarified that the development status of ElizaOS was not clear from public channels, while a moderator directed the user to a dedicated updates channel for the latest information. The exchange was generally civil and informative, with members pointing each other toward official resources.",
